# The SAT's official XSDs are kept byte for byte (CRLF, one with a BOM): their
# SHA-256 is checked against src/services/sat/anexo24/xsd/provenance.json, so
# git must never normalize their line endings. GitHub collapses them in diffs.
src/services/sat/anexo24/xsd/**/*.xsd -text linguist-generated=true
# The cadena original stylesheets vendored in the same tree follow the same rule.
src/services/sat/anexo24/xsd/**/*.xslt -text linguist-generated=true
